[00:05.471]
[00:06.007]
[00:06.927]Once upon a time
{"很久很久以前"}
[00:10.103]Morning glow, scattered light
{"晨光熹微　碎影斑驳"}
[00:13.927]Shone on you and I
{"洒落你我肩头"}
[00:17.063]In fading poems, frozen rhymes
{"褪色诗行里　凝固的韵脚"}
[00:21.009]
[00:21.186]
[00:21.447]Our traces on the breeze
{"风中飘散的痕迹"}
[00:24.209]Whispers of past revelry
{"往昔欢愉的絮语"}
[00:27.807]Please let me linger for now
{"请让我再停留片刻"}
[00:31.311]Enveloped in your sound
{"沉浸在你的声音里"}
[00:33.919]
[00:37.023]Love on the page, it's the ink our story's penned
{"纸上情话　是书写故事的墨迹"}
[00:42.953]No matter how it ends, I'd do it all again
{"无论结局如何　我愿从头再来"}
[00:49.192]
[00:50.239]Oh, stay true
{"噢　保持真诚"}
[00:52.799]Blossom as spring renews
{"当春日焕新时绽放"}
[00:55.585]Dream in colors, every hue
{"用所有色彩编织梦境"}
[00:58.704]Tomorrow's heights, to tomorrow's life
{"明日之巅　通往明日人生"}
[01:00.978]I'll walk in step beside you
{"我将与你并肩同行"}
[01:03.752]
[01:04.840]So, stay true
{"所以请保持初心"}
[01:06.920]Thaw winter's rime anew
{"重新消融冬霜"}
[01:09.816]Woven memories your boon
{"你赐予的编织回忆"}
[01:15.736]And like a melody, sing a song of reverie
{"如旋律般　吟唱幻想之歌"}
[01:21.104]
[01:51.036]Please, stay true
{"请务必坚守本真"}
[01:53.291]Cherish our memory
{"珍藏我们的记忆"}
[01:56.084]Go with love, your heart's your key
{"以爱为伴　心即是钥匙"}
[01:59.507]As rivers flow, oh, as gardens grow
{"似江河奔流　如花园盛放"}
[02:01.756]I hope you bloom in beauty
{"愿你绽放美丽"}
[02:04.926]
[02:05.315]See you soon
{"后会有期"}
[02:07.572]After the end of time
{"时光尽头之后"}
[02:10.412]In the melted frost and rime
{"在融化的霜雪中"}
[02:19.092]
[02:19.427]Now, stay true
{"此刻　请保持本真"}
[02:21.932]Blossom as spring renews
{"如春复苏般绽放"}
[02:24.557]Dream in colors, every hue
{"梦染斑斓　尽显万千色彩"}
[02:27.524]Tomorrow's heights, to tomorrow's life
{"明日之巅　通往明日人生"}
[02:29.916]I'll walk in step beside you
{"我将与你并肩同行"}
[02:33.307]
[02:33.771]Now, stay true
{"此刻　请保持本真"}
[02:36.070]Thaw winter's rime anew
{"重新消融冬日的冰霜"}
[02:38.843]Woven memories your boon
{"编织回忆是你的恩赐"}
[02:44.806]And like a melody, sing our reverie
{"如旋律般　吟唱我们的遐想"}
[02:51.516]And in our memory, pen the end of our journey
{"在记忆中　书写旅程的终章"}
[02:54.885]
